# Copy to .env (gitignored). See "Idea sessions", "Targets" and "Providers" in docs/FACTORY-CONTRACT.md.

# Dashboard idea sessions. Only idea-turn.ps1 reads the key, into a local variable. It is never put
# in the environment, so a subscription job's claude CLI stays on your subscription.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: the model for idea sessions (default claude-opus-5-5).
# FACTORY_IDEA_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5

# GitHub targets. Only factory.ps1 reads the token, and git gets it per command, never in a remote
# URL or .git/config. A fine-grained PAT on the owner's repos with Contents, Pull requests and
# Administration (to create new target repos) read/write, on All repositories. See docs/GITHUB-PAT.md.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# The owner the dashboard suggests for a new target (a user or an organization).
GITHUB_OWNER=

# Job providers. A job runs on its provider: subscription (the claude CLI's own login) or openrouter.
# New jobs get FACTORY_PROVIDER (default subscription); the dashboard's provider chip changes one.
# FACTORY_PROVIDER=subscription
# Only runner.ps1 reads the key, and only an openrouter job's claude process gets it. Use a dedicated
# key with a credit limit. See docs/OPENROUTER.md.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional: OpenRouter model ids for Claude Code's aliases (by default the aliases map to Claude ids).
# ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-5-5
# ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5
# ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL=anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5
# CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5

# Deploys: ephemeral Azure previews through HCP Terraform, between review and approve. Off until
# HCP_ORG is set. Only factory.ps1 reads these; see docs/DEPLOY.md.
# HCP_ORG=
# HCP_TOKEN=
# HCP_TEAM_TOKEN=
# HCP_AZURE_VARSET=
# AZURE_GH_CLIENT_ID=
# AZURE_TENANT_ID=
# AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=
# Where the dashboard's Lessons tab proposes template fixes (owner/name).
# FACTORY_TEMPLATES_REPO=
